e\">/</span><span class=\"text-white/80\" aria-current=\"page\">OCCTA customer code of practice</span></span></nav><p class=\"inline-flex max-w-full items-center gap-2.5 border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 py-1.5 font-sans text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-white/80 sm:text-[11px] sm:tracking-[0.2em]\"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2 flex-shrink-0\"><span class=\"hero-pulse absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping bg-primary opacity-70\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 bg-primary\"></span></span><span>OCCTA Legal &amp; Compliance</span></p><h1 class=\"mt-5 font-display uppercase leading-[0.88] tracking-[-0.01em] text-white text-[2.25rem] sm:text-5xl xl:text-6xl max-w-4xl\">OCCTA customer code of practice</h1><p class=\"mt-6 inline-block border-l-[3px] border-primary pl-3 font-sans text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/60\">Last updated: June 2026</p></div></section><section class=\"border-t-[3px] border-foreground bg-secondary text-foreground \"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-24 \"><div class=\"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_320px] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"prose prose-base max-w-3xl text-foreground [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-primary [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_h2]:mt-10 [&amp;_h2]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:border-t-[3px] [&amp;_h2]:border-foreground [&amp;_h2]:pt-6 [&amp;_h2]:font-display [&amp;_h2]:text-3xl [&amp;_h2]:uppercase [&amp;_h2]:leading-none [&amp;_h2:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;_li]:text-foreground/75 [&amp;_p]:text-foreground/75 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-2 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5\"><p>This Code of Practice summarises how OCCTA conducts itself with residential and small-business customers and the standards you can expect from us.</p><h2>Sales and signup</h2><ul><li>All sales are quote-led. You'll receive a Contract Summary covering price, contract length, fees, indicative speed and key terms before any payment is taken.</li><li>We do not use cold-call doorstep selling.</li></ul><h2>Service and switching</h2><ul><li>Residential broadband switches use One Touch Switch.</li><li>We will tell you if a Digital Home Phone migration could affect telecare or healthcare devices.</li></ul><h2>Billing</h2><ul><li>Residential prices are shown VAT inclusive. Business prices are shown VAT exclusive with VAT applied separately.</li><li>Itemised invoices are available in your dashboard.</li></ul><h2>Complaints</h2><p>See our <a href=\"/legal/complaints-code\">Complaints Code of Practice</a> — including escalation to ADR after 6 weeks.</p><h2>Vulnerable customers</h2><p>See our <a href=\"/legal/vulnerable-customers\">Vulnerable Customers Policy</a>.</p></div><aside class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start\"><div class=\"border-[3px] border-foreground bg-card\"><p class=\"border-b-[3px] border-foreground bg-primary px-5 py-2.5 font-sans text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-black\">Need to raise something?</p><p class=\"p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">See our <a class=\"font-medium text-foreground underline decoration-primary decoration-2 underline-offset-4\" href=\"/complaints\">complaints process</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:hello@occta.co.uk\" class=\"font-medium text-foreground underline decoration-primary decoration-2 underline-offset-4\">hello@occta.co.uk</a>.</p></div></aside></div></div></section></article></main><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[hsl(0_0%_5%)] text-white\"><div class=\"border-y-[3px] border-black bg-primary text-black\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1440px] flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center bg-black text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 2